  ;; Restoration over whole rows, edges included: Gaborish with clamped edges and the edge-preserving filter's three
  ;; steps with mirrored edges (8.0.0's gaborishRows and epfRows, the same sums in the same order).
  ;; gabRows(src, top, dst, outTop, width, height, y0, y1, side, diagonal, normal): rows y0 to y1 of one plane.
