  ;; lfPrepare(args, cfl, x, b, smooth, s0, s1, s2): the LF image before rendering. args holds i32 [p0 p1 p2 m0 m1 m2 o0 o1
  ;; o2 w0 w1 w2 h0 h1 h2 hs0 hs1 hs2 vs0 vs1 vs2]: the three LF planes p, the smoothing means m and output o, each
  ;; channel's extent and shifts. With cfl, p0 and p2 take chroma from luma (x, b); with smooth, o receives the adaptive
  ;; LF smoothing of p (8.0.0's smoothLF, its general loop, which its unsubsampled loop equals).
